    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Since the release, players have reported two minor issues, which have now been resolved:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Uncatchable Cat in the Hut in level 8: This issue has been fixed. The cat located on the table was malfunctioning and has been removed from the game entirely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievements Not Functioning Properly: Some achievements were not unlocking for players, which might have been caused by a lack of internet connection. We’ve implemented robust measures to prevent such problems in the future. Additionally, any missing achievements should automatically be synchronized and unlocked the next time the game is launched after applying the update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are confident that these improvements will enhance your gaming experience. Please don’t hesitate to reach out if you encounter any further issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enjoy the game and take it easy! 🐾",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
